              "replacement": "The `chromium_experimental_texel_buffers` extension allows to store WebGPU plain\ncolor format data with buffers, supporting format conversion on load and store\noperations. Texel buffers roughly translate to buffer textures in Vulkan\n(`Dim \u003d Buffer`), `texture_buffer\u003cformat\u003e` in Metal Shading Language, and typed\nUAV/SRV buffer views in HLSL/D3D12.\n"
            },
            {
              "path": "docs/tint/extensions/chromium_experimental_texel_buffers.md",
              "range": {
                "startLine": 9,
                "startChar": 0,
                "endLine": 10,
                "endChar": 0
              },
              "replacement": "No official WebGPU specification has been written yet, and implementations must\nnot expose this functionality without an explicit draft-enable flag.\n"
            },
            {
              "path": "docs/tint/extensions/chromium_experimental_texel_buffers.md",
              "range": {
                "startLine": 13,
                "startChar": 0,
                "endLine": 14,
                "endChar": 0
              },
              "replacement": "A new `texel_buffer` type, parameterized by the color format and the access mode:\n`texel_buffer\u003cFormat, Access\u003e`.\n"
