      "writtenOn": "2025-06-05T18:48:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The decision from our F2F last year was that this would be a language extension instead of an \"enable extension\". So instead of using `enable` you would (optionally) use `requires texel_buffers;`.\n\nIn `wgsl.def` that means using the `language_feature` enum instead of `extension`.",
      "revId": "450552940742cf65d0f698fe9722e21f36660c8c",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
